  "body": "A rare and unique opportunity to secure a beautifully positioned garden apartment in sought-after Mission Bay - offering space, sunshine, privacy and an enviable walk-everywhere lifestyle. Whether you're looking for a peaceful home, a lock-up-and-leave option or a smart investment, this apartment delivers an exceptional combination of comfort and convenience.\r\n\r\nSpacious and filled with natural light, the apartment has been partially renovated and is beautifully presented, with a new roof, fresh interior and exterior paint, new carpet and blinds, along with other thoughtful updates.\r\n\r\nAdditional highlights include:\r\n\r\n* Internal single lock-up garage\r\n\r\n* Generous storage cupboard\r\n\r\n* Private and peaceful garden setting\r\n\r\n* Excellent natural light and sunshine\r\n\r\n* Flat, easy walk to Mission Bay beach\r\n\r\n* Moments from parks, cafes, restaurants and local amenities\r\n\r\nEnjoy the best of Mission Bay with everything you need close at hand, while coming home to a quiet and private retreat. Properties offering this combination of space, outdoor appeal, parking and location are highly sought after - an opportunity not to be missed!",
